{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"report_supported\": \"cannot_tell\",\n  \"judge_supported\": \"cannot_tell\",\n  \"report_quotes\": [\n    \"DOI:10.1101/2025.01.10.632393 | Subthalamic Signature of Freezing of Gait in Parkinson’s Disease (2025)\",\n    \"preprint (which was not certified by peer review) is the author/funder. All rights reserved. No reuse allowed without permission.\",\n    \"the copyright holder for this version posted January 11, 2025. ; https://doi.org/10.1101/2025.01.10.632393 doi: bioRxiv preprint\"\n  ],\n  \"judge_quotes\": [\n    \"2. Mirelman, A. et al. Gait impairments in Parkinson’s disease. Lancet Neurol 18, 697–708 (2019).\",\n    \"42. Thevathasan, W. et al. Alpha oscillations in the pedunculopontine nucleus correlate with gait performance in parkinsonism. Brain 135, 148–160 (2012).\",\n    \"Statistics: Title: 64 characters including spaces, Running title: 26 characters including spaces; Abstract 349 words; Text 5321 words; 6 Figures, 82 References.\"\n  ],\n  \"why\": \"两项均判为 cannot_tell。第一，附件全文确认了论文标题、DOI及其bioRxiv预印本身份，但没有出现 PMID:40709562、PMID:23225012，也没有报告X的正文或结构化参考文献附录。因此，无法根据论文全文验证报告所称的两个PMID映射是否存在，更无法确认至少六篇预印本被错误关联的情况。第二，指控者关于 PMID:23225012 实际对应2012年一般性帕金森病综述的描述，也无法由附件全文验证。全文参考文献中，2012年的第42条是关于脑脚桥核α振荡与帕金森病步态表现的研究，而第2条《Gait impairments in Parkinson’s disease》发表于2019年。全文没有将这两条参考文献与 PMID:23225012 建立对应关系。因此，不能据此确认或否定指控者关于该PMID实际对应文献的说法，也不能确认报告正文与结构化附录之间的映射矛盾。关键区别是：全文没有提供相关PMID映射证据，并不等于全文证明这些映射错误。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "86119ce4-b937-40a9-b918-c7a7d7351f5c", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261113T200812802729Z", "elapsed_seconds": 69.688, "completed_utc": "2026-11-13T20:09:22.493966+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "his